Demogorgon should not be any problem, if you have an assault rifle and
well-enchanted bullets (+4 is sufficient). You do not even need to have
a means to cure illness (although that is better). Here is my approach:
When I notice I am on his level, I read an *uncursed* scroll of earth
while on the stairs (check before that there is room to move boulders,
if not, do some digging). Then I displace one boulder to get away from
the stairs and move it back. So he cannot get on the upstairs. I usually
magic map the level. Then proceed to a wall so he can see you as soon as
you dig through. Engrave Elbereth, get a cursed scroll of teleportation
or a cursed potion of gain level ready, zap a wand of digging at the
wall. If he does not immediately teleport to you, shoot at him or zap an
attack wand. He will teleport to you but turn to flee. Hit him with a
melee weapon until he teleports to the upstairs. Read teleportation or
quaff your potion to get one level up. Switch to the assault rifle
before you go downstairs. You are now in a boulder fort with Demogorgon
two squares away from you. Shoot him, but verify each time whether he
has changed position. This is much safer than killing Sam as a giant
shoggoth.

